   "body": "[~stevenschlansker] For this Jira, where title is specific to the issue fixed by [~rishi08rana] in the PR [https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23444/], I am marking the Jira as resolved.\r\n\r\nFor discussion around separate config and decompression max bytes, the idea is to maintain `telemetry.max.bytes` to right config which fits the uncompressed metrics bytes. Compression is to save on network bandwidth for metrics request. In case you think we need an improvement there then please open a follow up which can be discussed separately.",
